# The Docusaurus i18n tree is a build artifact: `kapi up` writes it from the
# source plus the committed context, so a fresh clone regenerates it and a diff
# never carries a generated translation. The committed record for this site is
# the content memory under .kapi/memory/ and the decisions under .kapi/state/.
i18n/
build/
.docusaurus/
node_modules/
